    "body": "<!-- claude-projects-attribution: {\"github_login\":\"siainbuletin\"} -->\n_Requested by **Sia** · [project thread](https://claude.ai/code/project/chan_01KaQfLZaF43QUMN3kcT7pW2?thread=cmsg_01KaQfLZaF43QUMN3kcT7pW2J9HMwMQop9eind1BT97bcY)_\n\nFollows #280, #348, #351, #354 and #359 (merged).\n\n## What\n- **Changed `.bib` fields** (`sp-litnotes-meta-fill-all-dryrun` / `-convert`):\n  - a pub-author, pub-editor, pub-title or pub-year that differs from the BibTeX entry is now listed as `update KEY :: old -> new`\n  - new option `sp-litnotes-meta-update-changed` (default on); with it off, a prefix argument still forces updates\n  - `bib-parent` is never updated here\n- **bib-parent lint** (`sp-litnotes-meta-parent-lint-dryrun` / `-convert`):\n  - lists notes whose bib-parent links the note itself, links another note than the crossref's, or has no crossref in the entry, or whose crossref has no note\n  - shared report buffer: `d` drops a note for later, `u` brings it back, `A` fixes the rest\n  - convert asks once, then per batch: fix all, choose note by note (fix, remove the link, skip), skip or quit\n  - backup of each note first, same folder as the meta fill\n- **Stop after a few batches**:\n  - new `sp-batch-report-run-batches` and `sp-batch-report-batch-size` (50): before each batch apply, choose each, skip, or quit; what was not reached stays as it was\n  - used by the meta fill convert, the bib-parent lint, `sp-vulpea-meta-order-convert` and the keyword conversion of all notes\n  - not yet: litnote titles and refs converts (they write in `sp-async-work` timer slices) and the BibTeX lint, which already has apply/skip/quit per batch\n\n## Tests\n- 74 tests (batch report, litnote meta, meta order, keyword conversion) pass in Emacs 29, including new ones for quit, skip, choose, update detection and the four lint kinds. Tangle check: the four changed modules match their docs ignoring whitespace.\n- Not run on the real vault.\n\nNo CHANGELOG edits, per the nightly-tidy rule. The branch is not prefixed with the PR number, because the session's branch name was fixed.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code/session_01WWLNi8qQ8TAueQ5i6VMnVy)_",
