                "message": "✨ feat: update changed litnote fields, lint bib-parent, stop batches early\n\n- sp-litnotes-meta: the batch lists pub-* values that differ from the .bib as\n  updates (old -> new); sp-litnotes-meta-update-changed turns it off\n- sp-litnotes-meta-parent-lint-dryrun/-convert: find wrong bib-parent links\n  (self, other note, no crossref, crossref without note), drop with d/u, fix in\n  batches with fix/remove/skip per note\n- sp-batch-report-run-batches: batches of 50 with apply/choose/skip/quit; used by\n  the meta fill, the meta order and the keyword conversion\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WWLNi8qQ8TAueQ5i6VMnVy",
